        "original_id": "fe3b2313-e11c-5153-959b-7d6445998fc3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Affenpinscher, Villanuco de Las Encartaciones, German Pinscher, Dobermann, Rottweiler, Miniature Pinscher, Standard Schnauzer, Miniature Schnauzer, Giant Schnauzer\n- Places: Las Encartaciones, Biscay, Cantabria, Burgos, Spain\n- Concepts: dog breeds, breed origins\n\nFacts:\n- The Affenpinscher is also known as the Monkey Terrier and is a terrier-like toy breed of dog.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is a Spanish breed of dog typical of Las Encartaciones in Biscay, Cantabria, and northern Burgos in Spain.\n- The German Pinscher is included in the origins of the Dobermann, the Rottweiler, the Miniature Pinscher, the Affenpinscher, and the Standard Schnauzer.\n- The Standard Schnauzer is, by extension, included in the origins of the Miniature Schnauzer and the Giant Schnauzer.",
